      "party": "Democratic",
      "incumbent": true,
      "summary": "Maggie Goodlander is the first-term incumbent U.S. Representative for New Hampshire's 2nd Congressional District, first elected in 2024. Before Congress, she served as a Deputy Assistant Attorney General in the Biden Justice Department, as a foreign policy adviser to U.S. Senators John McCain and Joe Lieberman, and as counsel to the House Judiciary Committee during the first impeachment of President Donald Trump. She is focusing her re-election campaign on lowering costs, protecting health care, and standing up to the Trump administration.",
